YOLOX
License: Apache-2.0
Upstream: https://github.com/Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX
Copyright (c) 2021-2022 Megvii Inc. All rights reserved.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The released detector weights are a modified, fine-tuned derivative of the
YOLOX-Nano COCO-pretrained weights by Megvii Inc. (yolox_nano.pth, release
0.1.1rc0). Modified by this project: the class-prediction layers were replaced
by two classes (card face, card back) and the network was trained further.

Two source files contain code adapted from YOLOX at commit
6ddff4824372906469a7fae2dc3206c7aa4bbaee and state their changes at the top:

  * cardvision/train_detector/loss.py (from yolox/models/yolo_head.py):
    modified so that the objectness loss leaves out anchors in ignore regions.
  * cardvision/train_detector/augment.py (from
    yolox/data/datasets/mosaicdetection.py and yolox/data/data_augment.py):
    modified so that mosaic tiles come from named streams in stated shares and
    carry face, back and ignore codes.

The network, the assignment of anchors to targets and the optimizer set-up are
called from the YOLOX package and are not copied here. YOLOX is not bundled; it
is installed separately by whoever trains or exports a detector.

YOLOX is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, the same license as
this project. Its text is in the file LICENSE. The upstream repository has no
NOTICE file.

