The recognizer's network is torchvision's MobileNetV3-Small without its
classifier. The released recognizer weights were initialized from torchvision's
MobileNetV3-Small ImageNet weights (MobileNet_V3_Small_Weights.IMAGENET1K_V1)
and trained further by this project. Those weights were pretrained by
torchvision's authors on the ImageNet-1k dataset. torchvision's documentation
says that pretrained weights may carry terms from the dataset they were trained
on. torchvision is not bundled.

