browser/opencv.lock.json pins (5.0.0), with only the functions the stage calls
(browser/scripts/opencv-whitelist.py). The build is not kept in this
repository. It is compiled from OpenCV unmodified. The script writes the
licenses of what it holds beside it, in opencv.mjs.LEGAL.txt.

